phic category\"},\n{\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"The model included a linear term for time, along with sex, grade, race/ethnicity, school district, and SES.\"},\n{\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"The model was stratified by sex, grade, school district, and SES to examine obesity trends in subgroups.\"}],\n\"confidence\": \"medium\",\n\"uncertain_fields\": [\"study_design\"]}", "type": "text"}]}